1. INTRODUCTION

The Fraunhofer FDK AAC Codec Library for Android ("FDK AAC Codec") is
software that implements the MPEG Advanced Audio Coding ("AAC") encoding
and decoding scheme for digital audio. This FDK AAC Codec software is
intended to be used on a wide variety of Android devices.

AAC's HE-AAC and HE-AAC v2 versions are regarded as today's most efficient
general perceptual audio codecs.

